    <details class="bp-faq-item"><summary class="bp-faq-q">What size should I get?</summary><p class="bp-faq-a">They run firm at true-to-size for a compression fit. If you're between sizes or prefer a more relaxed feel, we recommend sizing up one size.</p></details>
    <details class="bp-faq-item"><summary class="bp-faq-q">Will my phone fit in the pocket?</summary><p class="bp-faq-a">Yes! The side hidden pocket fits phones up to iPhone 15 Pro Max size. The back pocket is great for cards, keys, or AirPods.</p></details>
